{
  "_comment": [
    "Two floppy drives and a hard disk, and a CD-ROM drive. The frontend",
    "mounts every file read-only: what the machine writes to a disk is kept in",
    "the machine's memory (waterbox/chimera-overlay.c), so states carry it and",
    "your file is never changed. Only the first file of a slot is in the drive:",
    "swapping disks is not there yet. The CD-ROM drive is an ATAPI drive, the",
    "second drive of the hard disk controller; its audio is made in place",
    "(patch 0007)."
  ],
